oduct/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan_FUT002","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002","label":"Gloss White"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-White_FUT002-MW","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-mw","label":"Matte White"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Black_FUT002-MB","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-mb","label":"Matte Black"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Ivory_FUT002-IV","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-iv","label":"Matte Ivory"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Sand_FUT002-SA","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-sa","label":"Matte Sand"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Cement_FUT002-CE","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-ce","label":"Matte Cement"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Forest_FUT002-FO","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-fo","label":"Matte Forest"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Tobacco_FUT002-TB","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-fut002-tb","label":"Matte Tobacco"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Crete_FUT002-CR","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-cr","label":"Matte Crete"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Ash_FUT002-HA","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-ha","label":"Matte Ash"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Anthracite_FUT002-AT","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-at","label":"Matte Anthracite"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Matte-Blackboard_FUT002-BB","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-bb","label":"Matte Blackboard"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Gloss-Pink-Powder_FUT002-PP","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-pp","label":"Gloss Pink Powder"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Gloss-Tortora_FUT002-TO","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-to","label":"Gloss Tortora"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Gloss-Burnt-Sienna_FUT002-BS","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-bs","label":"Gloss Burnt Sienna"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Gloss-Petrol_FUT002-PT","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-pt","label":"Gloss Petrol"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Gloss-Sugar-Paper_FUT002-SP","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-sp","label":"Gloss Sugar Paper"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Pan---Gloss-Indigo_FUT002-IN","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut002-in","label":"Gloss Indigo"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div><div>Introducing Futura the latest evolution in bathroom design from Italian manufacturer Hatria. Winner of multiple international design awards, Futura embodies purity in form and performance. Its patented PURE VORTEX  flush delivers a powerful, rimless vortex flow that is remarkably quiet, redefining expectations of both functionality and acoustic comfort in the bathroom. </div><div>With its pared-back silhouette and flush inlet positioned discreetly at the front of the bowl, Futura presents an almost sculptural clarity”free from visible outlets or unnecessary detail. This is a toilet designed not to draw attention, but to elevate the spatial experience with quiet innovation, refined engineering, and a commitment to modern minimalism.</div><div><div>The  PURE VORTEX flush relies on the gravitational force of the In Wall Cistern flush to ensure exceptional flush performance. It is recommended to install the Futura Wall Faced Pan (FUT002) in all  gloss or matte  coloured finish with a standard-height in-wall cisterns, such as the OLI 74 Wall Cistern (<a href=\"#/product/sku-601602-pn\">601602/PN</a> or <a href=\"#/product/sku-601602-mc\">601602/MC</a>).</div><div>Low-level cisterns produce a wider range of gravitational force during a flush; therefore, the Futura Wall Faced Pan is only recommended and warranted to be paired with the Expert Evo Low-Level Cistern (<a href=\"#/product/sku-721006-pn\">721006/PN</a> or <a href=\"#/product/sku-721006-mc\">721006/MC</a>) for Lower Level Applications.</div><div>The Futura’s elongated, fully glazed channel ensures a controlled and powerful PURE VORTEX flush. In some applications, surplus water may remain in the channel after flushing and gradually empty into the toilet bowl as the channel clears.</div></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
